Hi, fellow Kings and Queens!

I've finally managed to finish working on new in-game events for the upcoming KingSim update.
I know it took me much longer than anticipated, but I've tried to make new decisions for players as fun and as meaningful as in the main story mode. In my estimation, the new KingSim update will provide players with about an additional hour to rule and make tough decisions.

What left to do:
- New character animations;
- New death concept art and animation;
- Few small changes and game improvements;
- Testing of new content and bug fixing;

I'll try to finish the Major KingSim update as quickly as possible. Thanks for waiting and believing in me!

Woohoo, Pancake Week is on! This means:
- A nice discount for new Kings and Queens during the event;
- A lot of Russian-made games are on discount as well;
- I'll be streaming the game every day (or almost every day) from 8 to 14 of Match, chatting with viewers and some of my gamedev colleagues;

In Russia, the celebration of the end of winter is called "Masleniza". Usually, we bake pancakes during this period and put hay stuffed dummy on fire (pretty medieval, right?). We also dance, sing, play games outside with children, and ride horses. 

